name: 📄 New Page Creation
description: Request for a new page or section in the application
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        If you believe that our application could benefit from a new page or section, you're in the right place!

        Please fill out this form as completely as possible to describe the new page you're envisioning.
  - type: input
    attributes:
      label: Page Title
      description: What should the title of the new page be?
      placeholder: 'Enter the title of the page here.'
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Purpose of the Page
      description: Explain what the purpose of the page will be and what content it should include.
      placeholder: 'Describe the purpose and content of the page.'
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Target Audience
      description: Who is this page for? Describe the target audience.
      placeholder: 'Detail the audience that would find this page useful.'
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Features and Functionalities
      description: List the features and functionalities that the page should have.
      placeholder: 'e.g., contact form, image gallery, live chat widget'
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Reference Sites or Pages
      description: Provide URLs or references to similar pages or designs that you find relevant or inspiring.
      placeholder: 'List any reference sites or pages here if applicable.'
  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Visuals and Design
      description: Describe any specific visual elements or design principles the page should adhere to.
      placeholder: 'Describe the page's desired look and feel.'
  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Additional Information
      description: Any other details or context you'd like to add? Feel free to include it here.
